<title>UK: Euromarket turnover fell in week to Mar 20 - ISMA.</title>
<headline>Euromarket turnover fell in week to Mar 20 - ISMA.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Turnover in Eurobond and related markets fell to $1.128 trillion in the week to March 20 from $1.131 trillion the previous week, International Securities</p>
<p>Market Association data showed (in billions of dollars):</p>
<p>					  Latest week	Previous week</p>
<p> Primary market:		     48.01		65.93</p>
<p> Of which U.S. dollar issues     22.55		28.01</p>
<p> Secondary market:		 1080.37	    1065.90</p>
<p> Of which U.S. dollar issues    223.42	     272.06</p>
<p> Cleared through Euroclear	833.27	     855.04</p>
<p> Cleared through Cedel	    295.12	     276.79</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
